              text: "Your diving bell is fitted with a rigid hull. When you [Face Danger](datasworn:move:starforged/adventure/face_danger) to test its strength against the crushing depths, roll +integrity and add +1. When you must [Withstand Damage](datasworn:move:starforged/suffer/withstand_damage) against pressure or impact, take +1 momentum or +1 integrity on a strong hit.",
